UniXNU 3fd6a3c: a source storage without a root is built probe-only, gap G2 of macOS-Pad-6

With [storage] root = "none" (patches/unixnu/0003) the recipe already links no root policies, so NativeUfs can
publish no verified root window; its block devices and root publication (NativeUfsBlock, startRoot, the media report
and the raw userdata block test) are then code such a board never runs. NativeUfs.cpp has a switch for exactly that,
NATIVE_UFS_PROBE_ONLY ("the block device and root publication pull in IOStorageFamily/VerifiedRoot; a probe-only
build keeps the controller probes"); this sets it when UNIXNU_SOURCE_STORAGE_ROOT=none. Boards with a root are
unchanged. For macOS-Pad-6 it keeps the code that could publish userdata out of the kernel entirely, and makes the
archive smaller: the pipa kernel with it linked missed the macOS 26.5 collection's __PRELINK_TEXT hole by 6,176
bytes (kernel-build run 43136731212). Applies after 0001 and 0003.

